        "whatToVerify": "XJS electrics are famously complex — confirm all electronics function (windows, top, AC, instrument cluster). Inspect timing chain tensioner and cooling system. Factor in higher-than-average maintenance costs.",
        "bottomLine": "A handsome classic at honest low miles with clean history. Get a Jaguar specialist pre-purchase inspection; budget $300–600 for any deferred maintenance items."
      },
      {
        "rank": 3,
